Subject: Restore whole original NL font and escape flow with native word/ownership ABI
Upstream-base: dc238202b310059d80791d0140dee37f27b9a3bf

Historical body extractions are retired separately. Keep the complete original
control flow, glyph layout, metrics, kerning, passes and requests. Adapt Wii32
scalars and BE keys, stack allocation syntax, pointer-token sentinels, native
matrix handles, template emission and owning game allocation/free. No alternate
font manager, successful texture upload or readiness is introduced.

